    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d18-a9">

                <pb facs="0303" n="293" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv07/pg293"/>

                <head>Appendix G to HD–13</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]<anchor n="22" xml:id="d18-f1"
                    /></seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-23">July 23, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">From: President Clemenceau.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">To: President Von Lersner.</p>
                <p>The Supreme Council of the Allied and Associated Powers has taken note of the
                    communication received from the German Delegation under date of July 16,
                        1919,<anchor n="23" xml:id="d18-f2"/> requesting that the names and
                    credentials of the Representatives of the Allied Powers to Eastern Prussia be
                    communicated to the German Government before the arrival of these
                    Representatives.</p>
                <p>The Supreme Council estimates that these nominations cannot be made before the
                    ratification and entry into force of the Peace Treaty. At the proper time, the
                    German Government will be, through the mediation [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >medium?</hi>] of the German Delegation, informed of the names and
                    credentials of the said Representatives.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
